<title>USA: Sri Lanka to buy $10 mln in wheat under PL480.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka to buy $10 mln in wheat under PL480.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka received authorization to buy $10 million worth of U.S. wheat under Public Law 480, the U.S. Agriculture Department said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The authorization provides for about 55,000 tonnes of wheat, grade U.S. No. 2 or better, the agency's Foreign Agricultural Service said.</p>
<p>The contracting period is May 20 through Sept. 30 with delivery between May 20 and the end of the year.</p>
</text>
